Publishable JSONL line (the only JSONL line; also at batch-r17.jsonl):

```json
__FINAL_JSONL__
```

Validation receipt (final): checks passed / fixed as reported by
build_r17.py self-validate (check_jsonl, raster_status, verify_record_execution,
spike_probe --strict).
